<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3597] IgniteConfiguration.igniteWorkDir has no effect</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3597</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;U.setWorkDirectory method ensures that work dir is set only once.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If there are multiple nodes in a process, or a node is stopped and then started, IgniteConfiguration.igniteWorkDir is ignored.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12993185">IGNITE-3597</key>
            <summary>IgniteConfiguration.igniteWorkDir has no effect</summary>
